        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo EH-161-630 Extra Large Latch Hole Strike Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nExtra Large Latch Hole ANSI Strike Plate. The extended height (1/2\" longer than normal) latch hole cut out allows a door latch, to hook into the strike plate, when the door and frame are out of align.   Package includes stainless steel strike plate with installation screws for use on either wood or metal doors and frames. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/ansi-stainless-steel-strike-plate-don-jo-st-161-630\"><b>Standard ANSI Stainless Steel Strike Plate</b></a><br>\r\nAlso see: <a href=\"/pages/how-to-fix-sagging-doors-part-1-doors-with-metal-frames\"><b>How to Fix a Sagging Door</b></a> and <a href=\"/pages/how-to-install-door-hinge-shims\"><b>How to Shim a  Door</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-EH-161-630_size.gif?v=1704354776\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Extended Height ANSI Strike Plate Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo EH-161-630 Stainless Steel Strike Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width to Lip: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Total Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Hole Height: 1-3/4\" ( 1.750\" )</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Brushed Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Screws: #12-24 Flat Head Combo Screws (for wood or metal doors)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EH-161.pdf?v=1704262417\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo EH-161-630 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
